%
%"For Rev. Edmund Robinson on the occasion of his 70th Birthday. 
%For over 10 years, until his retirement, Edmund served as minister 
%at the Unitarian Universal Church in Chatham. In his spare time 
%he has supported virtually every trad session on Cape Cod, regardless 
%of genre. This support† contributes mighty to the vibrant session 
%life here. He plays fiddle, concertina, 5-stringed banjo, harmonica 
%and can always be counted upon for a song or a recitation. Edmund 
%gravitates towards sets of 3 or 4, 3 and 4 part reels in A, hence a 
%3 part reel in A for his special birthday." 

%%%
