S:S: RC3.217 ("Amhran na n-Oglach")
Z:Z: ABC/arr. BB
N:N: 1: Fittingly perhaps last tune in the Roches' book is their arrangement  
N:of "Amhran na bhFiann" ("Soldiers' Song") national anthem of Ireland. 
N:I think Roche's name ("oglaigh" = "volunteers") is the original. 
N:N: 2: The Wikipedia article on "Amhran na bhFiann" provides a lot of amus-
N:ing insight into the Irish way of thinking (God bless it).
N:(https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amhrán_na_bhFiann)
